But just, I have to study a lot, but before this I want to answer a point that you said.

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:18.520
See, according to us, what we believe is that the word of the Torah, any written word,

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:21.520
could be twisted any way you want it.

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:25.520
Any way, there is no word, no matter how clear it is written, that it cannot be twisted.

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:28.520
Let me give you an example. This example is made by my managers.

00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:33.520
Take the most important Pasuk of the Torah, Shema Yisrael Adonai Eloheinu Adonai Echad.

